    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d704-a1">

                <pb facs="0926" n="814" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg814"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Mexico</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Fletcher</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-29T12:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 29, 1918, 12 noon.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1668. Your 1750, November 25, 6 p.m. As commission appears to have been
                    functioning for some time Department must again ask what efforts are being made
                    to obtain replies to Embassy’s notes regarding commission.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
